# Generated model / validation artifacts — rebuilt by
# `python backend/weather/scripts/train_model.py`. Not committed: a metric must
# always come from a scripted run against the current code, never from a stale
# binary in the repository.
backend/weather/artifacts/

# The standalone Panchayat Weather Intelligence website lives in ../website
# (a top-level folder at the git root — the deployment root must contain no spaces).
# Nothing there is ignored, including data/weather-bundle.js: the published site
# must run with no build step, so the offline snapshot is a committed asset rather
# than a build output. Regenerate it with
# `python backend/weather/scripts/export_frontend_bundle.py`.